CHANGELOG.md

# Prettier is here for Markdown and YAML and nothing else - the two file types
# Biome does not format. Everything Biome does format is listed here so that a
# bare `prettier --write .` cannot quietly take the JSON off it and start a
# formatter war in the pre-commit hook.
#
# `.` and not a glob is what the scripts pass, deliberately: `**/*.{yml,yaml}`
# does not match dot directories, so it silently skipped every file under
# .github/ - the half of Prettier's remit nobody notices is missing. Scoping by
# this file instead means a new directory is covered by default rather than
# forgotten.
*.json
*.jsonc
*.ts
